==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge]] spawns.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Castle Guard (Enemy)|Castle Guard]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Because I'm Human (だってニンゲンだもの) is a reference to ''Ningen Damono'' (にんげんだもの), a poem by [[wikipedia:Mitsuo Aida|Mitsuo Aida]].

